</style><table class=\"infobox bordered\" style=\"width: 22em; font-size: small; float:right; text-align: left;\" cellpadding=\"2\"><tbody><tr>\n<th style=\"background: #ccf; text-align: center; white-space: nowrap; font-size: 110%;\" colspan=\"2\">火影忍者 疾風傳 忍立體繪卷！最強忍界決戰！！</th>\n</tr><tr>\n<td style=\"background: #ccf; text-align: center; border-top: 0px; border-bottom: 0px;\" colspan=\"2\"><span title=\"日語文本\"><span lang=\"ja\">NARUTO -ナルト- 疾風伝 忍立体絵巻! 最強忍界決戦!!</span></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"background: #ccf; text-align: center; border-top: 0px; border-bottom: 0px;\" colspan=\"2\"><i><span title=\"英語文本\"><span lang=\"en\">未定</span></span></i></td>\n</tr>\n\n\n\n<tr>\n<th colspan=\"2\" style=\"background: #ccf; text-align: center; white-space: nowrap;\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E7%94%B5%E5%AD%90%E6%B8%B8%E6%88%8F\" title=\"电子游戏\">遊戲</a></th>\n</tr>\n\n<tr>\n  <th style=\"background: #e6e9ff; white-space: nowrap; text-align: left; vertical-align: top;\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/%E7%94%B5%E5%AD%90%E6%B8%B8%E6%88%8F%E7%B1%BB%E5%9E%8B\" title=\"电子游戏类型\">遊戲類型</a></b></th>\n  <td>未定</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n  <th style=\"background: #e6e9ff; white-space: nowrap; text-align: left; vertical-align: top;\"><b>使用平台</b></th>\n  <td><a href=\"/wiki/%E4%BB%BB%E5%A4%A9%E5%A0%823DS\" title=\"任天堂3DS\">任天堂3DS</a></td>\n</tr>\n\n<tr>\n  <th style=\"background: #e6e9ff; white-space: nowrap; text-align: left; vertical-align: top;\"><b>開發團隊</b></th>\n  <td><a href=\"/wiki/Takara_Tomy\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Takara Tomy\">Takara Tomy</a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n  <th style=\"background: #e6e9ff; white-space: nowrap; text-align: left; vertical-align: top;\"><b>發行商</b></th>\n  <td>Takara Tomy（日本）<br />505 Games（欧洲）</td>\n</tr>\n\n<tr>\n  <th style=\"background: #e6e9ff; white-space: nowrap; text-align: left; vertical-align: top;\"><b>製作人</b></th>\n  <td>未定</td>\n</tr>\n\n\n\n\n<tr>\n  <th style=\"background: #e6e9ff; white-space: nowrap; text-align: left; vertical-align: top;\"><b>遊戲人數</b></th>\n  <td>未定</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n  <th style=\"background: #e6e9ff; white-space: nowrap; text-align: left; vertical-align: top;\"><b>發售日</b></th>\n  <td><span class=\"flagicon\"><span class=\"mw-image-border notpageimage\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%97%A5%E6%9C%AC\" title=\"日本\"><img alt=\"日本\" src=\"//upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/9/9e/Flag_of_Japan.svg/40px-Flag_of_Japan.svg.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"22\" height=\"15\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"//upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/9/9e/Flag_of_Japan.svg/60px-Flag_of_Japan.svg.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"900\" data-file-height=\"600\" /></a></span></span>2011年3月31日</td>\n</tr>\n\n\n\n<tr class=\"noprint\">\n<td style=\"background: #ccf; text-align: center; text-align:right; font-size: xx-small; background: #e6e9ff;\" colspan=\"2\"><a href=\"/wiki/Portal:%E5%8A%A8%E6%BC%AB\" title=\"Portal:动漫\">動漫主題</a>－<a href=\"/wiki/Portal:%E7%94%B5%E5%AD%90%E6%B8%B8%E6%88%8F\" title=\"Portal:电子游戏\">電子遊戲主題</a>－<a href=\"/wiki/WikiProject:ACG\" title=\"WikiProject:ACG\">ACG專題</a>－<a href=\"/wiki/Template:Infobox_animanga\" title=\"Template:Infobox animanga\">模板說明</a></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>《<b>火影忍者 疾風傳 忍立體繪卷！最強忍界決戰！！</b>》（日語：<span lang=\"ja\">NARUTO -ナルト- 疾風伝 忍立体絵巻! 最強忍界決戦!!</span>）是一款由<a href=\"/wiki/Takara_Tomy\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Takara Tomy\">Takara Tomy</a>开发并发行在<a href=\"/wiki/%E4%BB%BB%E5%A4%A9%E5%A0%823DS\" title=\"任天堂3DS\">任天堂3DS</a>平台上的《火影忍者》系列<a href=\"/wiki/%E5%8A%A8%E4%BD%9C%E6%B8%B8%E6%88%8F\" title=\"动作游戏\">动作</a>游戏。本作是《火影忍者》系列登录3DS上的首作。\n</p>\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading2\"><h2 id=\"外部連結\"><span id=\".E5.A4.96.E9.83.A8.E9.80.A3.E7.B5.90\"></span>外部連結</h2><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=%E7%81%AB%E5%BD%B1%E5%BF%8D%E8%80%85_%E7%96%BE%E9%A2%A8%E5%82%B3_%E5%BF%8D%E7%AB%8B%E9%AB%94%E7%B9%AA%E5%8D%B7%EF%BC%81%E6%9C%80%E5%BC%B7%E5%BF%8D%E7%95%8C%E6%B1%BA%E6%88%B0%EF%BC%81%EF%BC%81&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"编辑章节：外部連結\"><span>编辑</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></div>\n<ul><li><span style=\"font-family: sans-serif; cursor: default; color:var(--color-subtle, #54595d); font-size: 0.8em; bottom: 0.1em; font-weight: bold;\" title=\"日語\">（日語）</span><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20110602021026/http://www.takaratomy.co.jp/products/gamesoft/naruto_snk/\">遊戲官方網站</a></li></ul>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nParsed by mw‐web.codfw.main‐5d5456b949‐9p8bx\nCached time: 20260207105744\nCache expiry: 2592000\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.206 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.244 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 1042/1000000\nRevision size: 1513/2097152 bytes\nPost‐expand include size: 21303/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 2657/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 13/100\nExpensive parser function count: 4/500\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 8304/5000000 bytes\nLua time usage: 0.127/10.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 14932661/52428800 bytes\nNumber of Wikibase entities loaded: 0/500\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%  207.095      1 -total\n 52.64%  109.005      1 Template:Infobox_animanga/Headerofja\n 46.05%   95.377      4 Template:Infobox_animanga/CustomItem\n 44.89%   92.959      2 Template:Lang\n 31.74%   65.722      1 Template:Unreferenced\n 31.30%   64.826      2 Template:Ambox\n  8.63%   17.875      1 Template:Infobox_animanga/Game\n  4.12%    8.533      1 Template:Main_other\n  4.00%    8.278      1 Template:Infobox_animanga/Header2\n  3.29%    6.821      1 Template:IfPNS\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key zhwiki:pcache:1579518:|#|:idhash:canonical!zh and timestamp 20260207105744 and revision id 90196867. Rendering was triggered because: page_view\n -->\n</div>",
